NS_TXT_NAME=_acme-sfr.redcaraibe.fr     # = cible du CNAME posé sur ns1\n98: \n99: certbot certonly \\\n100:   --manual --preferred-challenges dns-01 \\\n101:   --manual-auth-hook    \"$PWD/scripts/acme/certbot-pdns-hook.sh add\" \\\n102:   --manual-cleanup-hook \"$PWD/scripts/acme/certbot-pdns-hook.sh del\" \\\n103:   -d retractation.sfrcaraibe.fr \\\n104:   --non-interactive --agree-tos -m l.rangon@outremer-telecom.fr \\\n105:   --config-dir ~/.certbot --work-dir ~/.certbot/work --logs-dir ~/.certbot/logs\n106: ```\n107: \n108: ### LPM — `retractation.lapostemobile.sfrcaraibe.fr`\n109: \n110: ```bash\n111: export PDNS_ZONE=redcaraibe.fr\n112: export PDNS_TXT_NAME=_acme-lpm.redcaraibe.fr\n113: \n114: certbot certonly \\\n115:   --manual --preferred-challenges dns-01 \\\n116:   --manual-auth-hook    \"$PWD/scripts/acme/certbot-pdns-hook.sh add\" \\\n117:   --manual-cleanup-hook \"$PWD/scripts/acme/certbot-pdns-hook.sh del\" \\\n118:   -d retractation.lapostemobile.sfrcaraibe.fr \\\n119:   --non-interactive --agree-tos -m l.rangon@outremer-telecom.fr \\\n120:   --config-dir ~/.certbot --work-dir ~/.certbot/work --logs-dir ~/.certbot/logs\n121: ```\n122: \n123: ## Mise en bundle dans le repo (convention `files/tls/<fqdn>/`)\n124: \n125: Après émission, le cert est sous `~/.certbot/live/<fqdn>/`. On versionne :\n126: chaîne publique en clair, **clé privée chiffrée ansible-vault** (clé Vault id 2).\n127: \n128: ```bash\n129: FQDN=retractation.redcaraibe.fr\n130: mkdir -p \"files/tls/${FQDN}\"\n131: cp \"$HOME/.certbot/live/${FQDN}/fullchain.pem\" \"files/tls/${FQDN}/${FQDN}_certificate_chain.pem\"\n132: ansible-vault encrypt \"$HOME/.certbot/live/${FQDN}/privkey.pem\" \\\n133:   --output \"files/tls/${FQDN}/${FQDN}_private_key.pem\"\n134: git add \"files/tls/${FQDN}/\"\n135: ```\n136: \n137: Puis déploiement : `deploy-tls-bundle` (tpl 38) sur le bon frontal, et bascule du\n138: vhost (`vhost_cert_provider: bundle`) + `deploy-nginx-vhost` (tpl 39).\n139: \n140: ## Renouvellement (futur)\n141: \n142: `certbot renew` rejoue les mêmes hooks. À automatiser plus tard (timer sur un hôte\n143: always-on joignant l'API PowerDNS + déploiement du bundle) — cf. backlog\n144: « automate manual cert renewals ».\n145: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
