oles/unbound_forwarder et playbooks/bootstrap-th2-dnsc-fwd3.yml. Ne bascule\n52: # aucun trafic client à ce stade : fwd1 et fwd2 restent seuls référencés dans\n53: # group_vars/all/main.yml (vsphere_vm_dns_servers).\n54: all:\n55:   hosts:\n56:     localhost:\n57:       ansible_connection: local\n58:     # th2-grafac-si1 : VM Grafana neuve (172.30.218.227), zone CORP, rattachée au runner\n59:     # Semaphore CORP (th2-ansic-ap1). Bootstrap système via playbooks/bootap-bebian13.yml\n60:     # (--limit th2-grafac-si1) — pas de config applicative Grafana dans ce repo pour\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
